=== NOTES ===
- Transport reverted to `ChatMessage = { role; content: string; images?: ChatImage[] }`; `ChatContentPart` removed from the public API and replaced by an internal `SerializedContentPart` used only when building the wire body.
- `client.ts` serialises image-bearing messages as `{ role, content: [{ type: 'text', text }, ...images.map(...)] }` and image-free messages as `{ role, content: string }`, so text-only request bodies are byte-identical to before. Image guards (`IMAGE_IN_SYSTEM_MESSAGE`, `IMAGES_NOT_SUPPORTED`) run before the token bound, reservation, and fetch. Bound is `inputTokenBound(messages, schema) + 1600 * imageCount`; `pricing.inputTokenBound` signature untouched.
- `pipeline-v2.ts` keeps all M7b behaviour; only `attachImageToUserMessage` changed to spread the base user message and set `images: [{ url: 'data:' + mime + ';base64,' + base64 }]` with `content` unchanged. Label generation/repair still require the image; other components ignore a supplied image.
- Tests updated to the new shape with the same coverage, plus an explicit byte-identical no-image test and a two-image per-image token-bound check. No API keys, bodies, or source text enter errors or receipts. `sam.ts` untouched.
